PASS: Holding F does not automatically repeat a swing
PASS: Escape freezes the bat swing and character
PASS: Resume completes the frozen swing
PASS: Landing on a green-frog pad applies poison
PASS: Poison continuously drains the visible health percentage
PASS: Pause freezes poison damage
PASS: Defeating the poisoning frog fully heals and cures the character
